@startuml C1_Incidents_Scenario_View
title C1 – Incidents (Scenario View)

left to right direction
skinparam usecase {
  BorderColor Black
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  ArrowColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "Port Logistics Management System (PLMS)" as System {
  usecase "List Incidents" as UC_List
  usecase "Filter Incidents" as UC_Filter
  usecase "Create Incident" as UC_Create
  usecase "Edit / Resolve Incident" as UC_Edit
  usecase "Delete Incident" as UC_Delete
  usecase "Consult Affected VVEs" as UC_Affected
}

Operator --> UC_List
Operator --> UC_Filter
Operator --> UC_Create
Operator --> UC_Edit
Operator --> UC_Delete
Operator --> UC_Affected

note right of UC_Affected
  Shows which vessel visit executions
  are impacted by a given incident.
end note

@enduml
